---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: janitorr-config
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
type: Opaque
stringData:
  application.yml: |
{#
  Rendered from the Docker role's template, not copied — this file is the deletion POLICY
  (expiration ladders, exclusion tags, which cleanups are enabled), and two copies of it that
  drifted would mean two different sets of media getting deleted.

  The one deliberate difference is `janitorr_dry_run`, which that template reads with a
  `default(false)` so only this side is overridden. The *arr URLs need no change: sonarr, radarr
  and jellyfin are Service names in this namespace too.

  A Secret rather than a ConfigMap because it embeds the Sonarr, Radarr and Jellyfin API keys —
  the same reason the Docker copy renders at 0600.
#}
{{ lookup('template', playbook_dir + '/roles/containers/janitorr/templates/application.yml.j2') | indent(4, true) }}
